            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The distribution of wood qualities between hard and soft wood is 28% hard wood and 72% soft wood. The volume refers to the bulked volume. The bulk density of wood chips is 239 and 169 kg/m3 of dry mass, for hard and soft wood respectively (i.e.188.6 kg/m3 of dry mass overall). Lower heating value = 3640 MJ/m3. Waste wood does not go through a specific treatment process.;
