        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Chopping of industrial residual wood in stationary electric chopper.\n\n# Included processes\nThis process includes transport of waste urban and demolition wood to the chopping facility (50 km), infrastructure, chopping of the wood into chips in the sawmill, consumption of water and disposal of effluents and wastes from sorting. Includes also the carbon dioxide credit. No specific treatment of the wood is considered. The gross calorific value of the biomass is not included as the product comes from waste.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
        </technology>
